---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: SITE.url },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Security', item: `${SITE.url}/security` },
    ],
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Security & Privacy"
  description="How Buoy Money keeps your financial data safe: read-only bank connections through Plaid, encryption in transit and at rest, and a promise never to sell your data."
  path="/security"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker" style="justify-content:center">SECURITY &amp; PRIVACY</p>
      <h1>Your money data, handled with care</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline:auto">
        Linking a bank should feel safe because it is, when it’s done right. Here’s exactly
        how Buoy protects your information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,48px)">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="trust-grid">
        <div class="card trust">
          <span class="t-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
          <h2>Read-only access</h2>
          <p>Buoy connects through Plaid and can <strong>only read</strong> transactions and balances. It can never move money, make payments, or change anything in your accounts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card trust">
          <span class="t-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</span>
          <h2>I never see your password</h2>
          <p>You log in to your bank through Plaid, your credentials go to your bank, not to me. Buoy never sees or stores your bank login.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card trust">
          <span class="t-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔐</span>
          <h2>Encrypted end to end</h2>
          <p>Your account data is encrypted both in transit and at rest. On your phone, data cached for offline use is protected by your device's built-in encryption and is deleted when you sign out. You can disconnect any institution at any time, which cuts off access immediately.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card trust">
          <span class="t-icon" aria-hidden="true">🚫</span>
          <h2>You’re the customer, not the product</h2>
          <p>I make money one way: your subscription. No ads, no commissions for pushing financial products, and I never sell or share your financial information. The specifics are in the <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card trust">
          <span class="t-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔗</span>
          <h2>Powered by Plaid</h2>
          <p>Buoy links accounts through Plaid, the same connection layer behind apps like Venmo, Robinhood, and Coinbase, used by thousands of banks and finance apps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card trust">
          <span class="t-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
          <h2>Architected, not bolted on</h2>
          <p>Security wasn’t left for later, it was designed in from day one. It’s the one part of Buoy I’d never put up for a vote.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose security-faq">
        <h2>Common questions</h2>
        <h3>Is Plaid safe?</h3>
        <p>Plaid is the connection layer thousands of banks and finance apps already rely on to link accounts securely. Using Plaid means Buoy never handles your bank credentials directly.</p>
        <h3>Can Buoy move my money?</h3>
        <p>No. The connection is read-only by design, there is no pathway for Buoy to make a payment or transfer.</p>
        <h3>What happens if I cancel?</h3>
        <p>You can disconnect your accounts and close your account at any time. There’s no lock-in.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="sec-cta card">
        <h2>Budget with peace of mind</h2>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href={SITE.appRegister} class="btn btn-primary">Start your free trial</a>
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-ghost">About Buoy Money</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--sky-top), var(--surface));
    padding: clamp(48px, 8vw, 88px) 0 clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .page-hero .lead {
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .trust-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .trust {
    padding: 30px 32px;
  }
  .t-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }
  .trust h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 14px 0 8px;
  }
  .trust p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .trust a {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .security-faq {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }
  .sec-cta {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 32px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .sec-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .trust-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
